# RISC-V Zicsr Extension — Control and Status Register Instructions
# QEMU decodetree format
# helm-ng project

# ============================================================================
# Field definitions
# ============================================================================

%rd       7:5
%rs1     15:5
%csr     20:12

# ============================================================================
# Argument sets and formats
# ============================================================================

# For CSRRW/CSRRS/CSRRC: rs1 is a register index
# For CSRRWI/CSRRSI/CSRRCI: rs1 field holds the 5-bit unsigned immediate (uimm5)

&csr     rd rs1 csr
@csr     ............ ..... ... ..... ....... &csr %csr %rs1 %rd

# ============================================================================
# CSR instructions
# ============================================================================

CSRRW    ............ ..... 001 ..... 1110011 @csr
CSRRS    ............ ..... 010 ..... 1110011 @csr
CSRRC    ............ ..... 011 ..... 1110011 @csr
CSRRWI   ............ ..... 101 ..... 1110011 @csr
CSRRSI   ............ ..... 110 ..... 1110011 @csr
CSRRCI   ............ ..... 111 ..... 1110011 @csr
